{"id":"c404a1963024e8a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-quantum-group.md","title":"Quantum Group","display":"df-quantum-group — Quantum Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quantum-group","aliases":["58-df-quantum-group","Quantum Group"],"display":"df-quantum-group — Quantum Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-hopf-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quantum-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quantum-group</span><span>Quantum Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-group — Quantum Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0f7663908a1058a\" href=\"?note=b0f7663908a1058a\" title=\"58-df-hopf-algebra\">58-df-hopf-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (vector space over the explicit field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S\">\\(m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S\\)</span> (Hopf-algebra structure maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in H\\otimes_k H\">\\(R\\in H\\otimes_k H\\)</span> (universal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-matrix)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> (coproduct followed by the tensor swap)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_H\\in H^H\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_H\\in H^H\\)</span> (identity endomorphism)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (Hopf-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0f7663908a1058a\" href=\"?note=b0f7663908a1058a\" title=\"58-df-hopf-algebra\">58-df-hopf-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S,\\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S,\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S,\\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S,\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23},R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}\\in H^{\\otimes_k3}\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23}=R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23},R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}\\in H^{\\otimes_k3}\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23}=R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}quasitriangular} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\land R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}(h)=R\\Delta(h)R^{-1})\\land(\\Delta\\otimes\\mathrm{id}_H)(R)=R_{13}R_{23}\\land(\\mathrm{id}_H\\otimes\\Delta)(R)=R_{13}R_{12}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}quasitriangular} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\land R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}(h)=R\\Delta(h)R^{-1})\\land(\\Delta\\otimes\\mathrm{id}_H)(R)=R_{13}R_{23}\\land(\\mathrm{id}_H\\otimes\\Delta)(R)=R_{13}R_{12}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S\\in V\\;\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S\\in V\\;\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}yang\\text{-}baxter} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\to\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}yang\\text{-}baxter} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\to\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Quantum group” has several inequivalent formal meanings; this atom fixes the common quasitriangular-Hopf-algebra convention.</li>\n<li>The base field is an explicit argument throughout, so tensor powers, invertibility, and the Hopf structure cannot silently use different scalar fields.</li>\n<li>The Yang–Baxter equation is a consequence of the two coproduct identities for the universal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-matrix, not a replacement for them.</li>\n<li>Drinfeld–Jimbo algebras <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_q(\\mathfrak g)\">\\(U_q(\\mathfrak g)\\)</span> are standard examples.</li>\n<li>q-analogues: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>-deformed numbers <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]_q = \\frac{q^n - q^{-n}}{q - q^{-1}}\">\\([n]_q = \\frac{q^n - q^{-n}}{q - q^{-1}}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Representation theory: braided tensor categories</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kassel, Quantum Groups</li>\n<li>Chari and Pressley, A Guide to Quantum Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-hopf-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"b0f7663908a1058a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hopf-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hopf-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"b0f7663908a1058a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (Hopf-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-hopf-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in H\\otimes_k H","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_H\\in H^H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S,\\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S,\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23},R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}\\in H^{\\otimes_k3}\\land R_{12}R_{13}R_{23}=R_{23}R_{13}R_{12}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}quasitriangular} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\land R\\in(H\\otimes_k H)^\\times\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}}(h)=R\\Delta(h)R^{-1})\\land(\\Delta\\otimes\\mathrm{id}_H)(R)=R_{13}R_{23}\\land(\\mathrm{id}_H\\otimes\\Delta)(R)=R_{13}R_{12}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S\\in V\\;\\operatorname{QuasitriangularHopfAlg}_S(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}group\\text{-}yang\\text{-}baxter} \\vdash \\operatorname{QuantumGroup}_S(H,k,R)\\to\\operatorname{YangBaxter}_S(H,k,R)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"U_q(\\mathfrak g)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"[n]_q = \\frac{q^n - q^{-n}}{q - q^{-1}}","display":false}],"bytes":2542,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1023","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-quantum-group.md|58-df-quantum-group]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["b0f7663908a1058a"]}